# The page of the web client a build with the `web` feature embeds (release builds turn it on): the SHA-256 of the
# bundle the repo ants-web builds (its scripts/build.sh prints it), the ants-web commit built, and the ants version the
# page is built for, which has to be the binary's. `scripts/web.sh --pin` writes this line; `scripts/web.sh` puts the
# pinned bundle in target/web, where crates/ants/build.rs takes it, and the build fails on a bundle of another digest
# or built for another ants version.
